<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issue.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said Tuesday that on December 11 it will redeem the entire $50 million principal amount of its 6.905 percent debentures due June 11, 1999.</p>
<p>The cusip number for the debentures is 3134A0S37.</p>
<p>Freddie Mac said it will redeem the debentures in their entirety at a price equal to 100 percent of principal.  It will pay principal plus accrued interest to the redemption date to holders of record as of the close of business on December 10.</p>
</text>
